#BlueLink7 ` , Link 8` , Link 8` , Link 8`



*MODELCODE Driver Model Handoff

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#Imports for steering angle and steering torque are activated with IMP_STEER_SW overwriting the Driver Model steering.
#
#A PID controller is defined to provide damping upon handoff.
#
#A slow vehicle in the left lane inhibits the ego vehicle from the desired lane change.
#
#After passing the slower car, the ego hands back steering control to the driver model to commence the single lane change maneuver.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

